title: Val
---
<<playMusic frisscityCalm>>
<<camera Understory>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<bike Luna_Neutral on>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<declare $knowsRedHint = false>>
<<declare $knowsGreenHint = false>>
<<declare $knowsBlueHint = false>>
Luna: The only thing I need is a big offer so I can get the hell home.
//////////// Play SFX of a motorcycle engine puttering or breaking down
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_surprised>>
Luna: Oh no. 
//////////// Play SFX of a motorcycle engine puttering or breaking down
//////////// Show animation of the motorcycle vigorously shaking or jittering
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
Luna: No, no, NO! You have no right to break down. Not on rent day! 
Luna: I’m totally screwed!
<<playSFX valMotorcycle>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_surprised>>
Luna: <i>I recognize those tires. And the baddie who rides them.</i>
<<place Val>>
<<bike Val on>>
Val: Luna! My favorite human delivery girl. Have you been making bank today?
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>
Luna: H-Hey, Val. No, not yet. Still getting the low-tipping vegans and—
//////////// Play SFX of a motorcycle engine puttering or breaking down
//////////// Show animation of the motorcycle vigorously shaking or jittering
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
<<expression Val laugh>>
Luna: —And uh, some small bike trouble stuff.
<<expression Val neutral>>
Val: It sure <i>sounds</i> big. Let me help you!
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: R-Really?
<<expression Val flirty>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy>>
Val: Really. Consider it my “favorite customer special!” Just this once.
<<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<pose Val SceneSample_ValFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit Val>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<camera ValFixBike>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
Val: Let’s see what we’re working with here…
Val: Oh it’s THIS manufacturer! They wire up all of their models the same way. Too bad the quality is a little…
Luna: Shitty?
Val: But this is an easy fix! The order should be tattooed in a real mechanic’s brain. 
<<set $knowsBlueHint = true>>
Val: Press the power cell. Hook up the neural link. Pulse blue before yellow. Enter charging phase 5…
<<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
Val: And there she roars!
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<camera Understory>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<bike Luna_Neutral on>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral happy>>
<<place Val>>
<<bike Val on>>
<<expression Val laugh>>
Luna: I owe you one. Seriously.
<<expression Val neutral>>
Val: Don’t mention it. She’s really on her last legs, though! 
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Val: You should stop by my shop to get some new parts. 
<<expression Val flirty>>
Val: Unfortunately, those aren’t for free.
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy>>
Luna:(Val really saved me. But, it’s kinda weird to see her on this side of town…)
<<expression Val neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>
Luna: (But this is my chance to talk to her! And maybe figure out her ideal type…)
Val: Something on your mind?
Luna: (BE COOL.)
<<jump ValChoices>>
===


title: ValChoices
---
-> Nice bike. How did you mod it? <<once>>
   <<detour Bike_Backstory>>
   <<jump ValChoices>>
-> You look...nice. <<once>>
   <<detour Poor_Flirting>>
   <<jump ValChoices>>
-> What are you doing here?
   <<expression Val flirty>>
   Val: A corner store queen never reveals her secrets!
   <<jump PressingVal>>
===


title: Bike_Backstory
---
<<expression Val laugh>>
Val: Well, aren’t you sweet? I reinforced the frame with carbon weave and mag-alloy ribs to handle abandoned traincars, vines, and anything Root Town might throw at you.
<<expression Val flirty>>
Val: But what’s <i>under</i> the hood is my favorite part. Every sensor, every light…I wired those by hand.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: (I’ve unleashed a gearhead beast. There’s no end to this conversation.)

->  Let her continue.
   <<set $goodend += 1>>
   <<expression Val neutral>>
   Luna: How’d you wire yours up?
   <<expression Val laugh>>
   Val: Mostly trial and error…and a whole lotta luck! 
   <<set $knowsGreenHint = true>>
   <<expression Val neutral>>
   Val: I found out the hard way that a green wire is the one you should save until the very end.
   <<expression Val flirty>>
   Val: Hook it up too early and the whole system’s gonna go haywire!
   Luna: Sounds…shocking.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
   <<expression Val neutral>>
   // Return to the original question node in Val, but remove this question since the player completed it.
->  Cut it short.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
   <<expression Val neutral>>
   Luna: I'll hit you up the next time I wanna upgrade my bike for dumb deliveries.
   Val: Oh. Of course.
   // Return to the original question node in Val, but remove this question since the player completed it.
===


title: Poor_Flirting
---
<<expression Val laugh>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy>>
Val: That's so sweet! You're cute.
Luna: (Cute!?)
<<expression Val flirty>>
Val: But if you think that'll land you a discount at the shop, then you'll need to try harder~
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>
Luna: L-Like what?
<<expression Val neutral>>
Val: Like getting your hands on a flux ring. They’re the first thing to get swiped off a new bike because it’s so expensive—and so shiny to the city creatures.
Val: If you get one, I can hook you up with something.
<<expression Val flirty>>
Val: Something REAL nice~
Luna: !!!
Luna: Well, I guess while we’re on the topic…

-> What’s your ideal type?
  <<expression Luna_Neutral shy>>
  <<expression Val laugh>>
  Val: Wow, you’re so bold, Luna!
  <<expression Val flirty>>
  Val: But that’s what I like.
  Val: Someone who’s bold, fiery, and daring.
  <<expression Val neutral>>
  <<set $knowsRedHint = true>>
  Val: Like daring enough to try and unlock a flux ring starting with any color other than red.
  <<expression Val flirty>>
  Val: Unless you dare to get zapped!
  <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>
  Luna: (Time to find a flux ring.)
-> Nevermind.
  Luna: (Nah, I don’t wanna be creepy…)
  <<expression Val neutral>>
  Val: What’s up?
  Luna: N-Nothing.
  Luna: (All I need is a flux ring to impress her…)
<<expression Val neutral>>
// Return to the original question node in Val, but remove this question since the player completed it.
===


title: PressingVal
---
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
<<expression Val worried>>
Val: …
Luna: (Is she hiding something…?)

-> Ignore it
   <<set $badend += 1>>
   Luna: (She's probably just picking up items to take back to her shop.)
   <<expression Val neutral>>
   Val: You’re so lost in thought that I’m feeling left out. Let me guess…   
   <<expression Val flirty>>
   Val: You’re thinking about me?
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>   
   Luna: W-What!? No! Ugh, it’s nothing.
   <<expression Val worried_onphone>>
   Luna: <i>Anything I noticed before has completely vanished.</i>
-> Press her
   <<set $goodend += 1>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>> 
   Luna: But your shop's IN Root Town. Aren’t you supposed to be open right now? You wouldn’t close the shop and come to Frisscity unless it was something important.
   Luna: Or is that the 'secret?'
   <<expression Val worried>>
   Val: …
   <<expression Val laugh>>
   Val: Boooo, you got me! My glass skin soda pop actually comes from a vendor in Frisscity.
   <<expression Val neutral>>
   Val: You probably think I’m a sellout. But my regulars love it. And when demand is high, well…you gotta feed into it!
   <<expression Val worried_onphone>>
   Val: And speaking of customers…
   <<wait 1>>
<<jump TheOffer>>
===


title: TheOffer
---
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
<<expression Val neutral>>
Val: Sorry, gotta jet! Root Town needs their glass skin soda.
<<expression Val flirty>>
Val: Stop by tonight, if you’re free. I’ll be open.
// SFX motorcycle engine turning on
<<playSFX valMotorcycle>>
// Val leaves
<<pose Val SceneSample_ValFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Val>>
Luna: There she goes…
Luna: <i>Val is everything I want to be.</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: <i>If it wasn't for my shitty situation, I'd be just like her.</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>
Luna: <i>Or WITH her? Hm, which is it…?</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Luna: Huh?
<<wait 0.5>>
<<place Zine>>
Luna: Looks like a zine page.
Luna: (A very gearhead zine.)
Luna: Let’s see what it says…
<<if $knowsGreenHint == true>>
Luna: Last goes green…
<<endif>> 
<<if $knowsBlueHint == true>>
Luna: Blue before yellow…
<<endif>> 
<<if $knowsRedHint == true>>
Luna: And red comes first…
<<endif>> 
Luna: The rest is covered in notes. I can’t make out anything else on the page. 
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_shy>>
<<bike Luna_Neutral on>>
Luna: (I’ll give it back to Val the next time I see her.)
<<exit Zine>>
<<wait 0.5>>
// SFX cyberdeck notification ping
<<playSFX notification>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
Luna: Jackpot.
Luna: <i>A big offer on the SL0P app finally lands on my screen.</i>
Luna: <i>I quickly accept the offer. It reveals the coordinates of my delivery order's pickup location.</i>
Luna: Time to roll.
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
// Luna leaves
<<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
<<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<fadeOut 1>>
<<jump Alleyway>>
===


title: Rent
---
<<wait 0.5>>
// A is Kaya (@KAYATOAST) and B is Luna (@LUNETTE), the player
Kaya: helllooooo! rent is due tomorrow. don’t forget!
-> waiting for one last big order. then i’ll pay up!
      <<set $goodend += 1>>
     Kaya: phew, thanks…that’s great to hear! and that's a good strategy.
-> how much is rent again?
     Kaya: smh
     Kaya: it’s 1,500 baecoins…and don’t forget this time!
-> buzz off or i might get into an accident
     <<set $badend += 1>>
     Luna: i can’t be found texting and driving
     Kaya: WOW, you’re one to talk about rules!!
     Kaya: you don’t even wear a helmet
     Kaya: look, i just need you to come thru this time. 

Kaya: i need your share by tomorrow morning 
Kaya: or our landlord might really kick us out this time!
===

title: Alleyway
---
<<camera Alleyway>>
<<playMusic cyberpunkStakeout>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: This app is trash. It <i>actually</i> took me to a trashpile.
// SFX of gull noise, short version
<<playSFX caw>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
// Enter Cybergull Leader sprite, with cog on
<<place CyberSeagull>>
<<expression CyberSeagull cog>>
Luna: <i>A cybergull with a shiny cog hobbles out from the shadows.</i>
// If player completed the Poor_Flirting node, then show the below
<<if visited("Poor_Flirting") == true>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: Shiny. Powerful. Expensive-looking. This could be the flux ring Val was talking about.
Luna: (If I can get this thing for her, she’ll give me something REAL nice…)
<<endif>>
<<if visited("Poor_Flirting") == false>>
// If else, show:
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: Looks expensive—and like a part I could use to upgrade my shitty bike! Maybe Val can help me…
<<endif>> 
<<jump Cybergull>>
===

title: Cybergull
---
<<declare $withCog = true>>
<<declare $puzzleSolved = false>>
<<declare $hasFluxRing = false>>
// SFX of gull noise, longer version
<<playSFX caws>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Luna: (But damn, this guy is a TANK! And FERAL! Do I risk it?)

-> Help the cybergull
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
    Luna: If you bite me, you die. 
    Luna: Nice…mutant…seagull…thing…
    <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
    // SFX of gull noise, short version
    <<playSFX caws>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
    Luna: I don’t have all day. Do you wanna become roadkill or not?!
    <<pose CyberSeagull SceneSample_CybergullFadeOut>>
    <<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
    <<wait 1>>
    <<exit CyberSeagull>>
    <<exit Luna_Neutral>>
    <<fadeOut 2>>
    <<camera CybergullCG>>
    <<fadeIn 2>>
    Luna: Looks like some kind of locking mechanism.
    Luna: Maybe I need to touch the wires in a certain order?
    Luna: I better be careful...
    <<fadeOut 2>>
    <<wait 1>>
    <<wait_for_wire_puzzle>>
    <<jump PuzzleState>>
-> Don’t help the cybergull
    <<set $withCog = true>>
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
    Luna: I can’t risk getting rabies, or whatever chemical disease you have.
    Luna: Now where's that dumb delivery...
    <<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
    <<wait 1>>
    <<exit Luna_Neutral>>
    <<playSFX caw>>
    Luna: <i>A grudge brews behind the gull’s glasses.</i>
    <<pose CyberSeagull SceneSample_CybergullFadeOut>>
    <<wait 1>>
    <<exit CyberSeagull>>
    <<fadeOut 2>>
    <<jump TransporterPod>>
===


title: PuzzleState
---
<<if $puzzleSolved == false>>
   <<jump FluxRingGotAway>>
<<else>>
   <<jump FluxRingSuccess>>
<<endif>>
===


title: FluxRingGotAway
---
<<set $withCog = true>>
<<camera Alleyway>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral angry>>
<<place CyberSeagull>>
<<expression CyberSeagull cog>>
<<playSFX caws>>
Luna: Damn, I was so close!
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: What doesn’t kill you makes you stronger, I guess…?
<<pose CyberSeagull SceneSample_CybergullFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<playSFX caws>>
<<exit CyberSeagull>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_angry>>
Luna: Guess he can’t take a joke.
// If player completed the Poor_Flirting node, then show the below
<<if visited("Poor_Flirting") == true>>
Luna: But damn, I missed my chance at a flux ring. Guess I’ll have to impress Val another way…
<<endif>>
Luna: Well, it’s not my problem anymore.
<<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<wait 2.5>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump TransporterPod>>
===


title: FluxRingSuccess
---
<<camera Alleyway>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral happy>>
<<place CyberSeagull>>
<<expression CyberSeagull cogless>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<set $withCog = false>>
// If player completed the Poor_Flirting node, then show the below
<<if visited("Poor_Flirting") == true>>
Luna: My precious.
Luna: (Now Val <i>has</i> to give me something REAL nice…!)
<<endif>>
<<if visited("Poor_Flirting") == false>>
// If else, show:
Luna: So this is a ‘flux ring…’
Luna: Well, whatever it is, I can’t wait to install this bad boy into my bike!
<<endif>> 
<<playSFX caws>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
<<wait 1>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Luna: (Is he…aura farming?)
<<pose CyberSeagull SceneSample_CybergullFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<playSFX caws>>
<<exit CyberSeagull>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: Hmph. You’re welcome.
<<set $hasFluxRing = true>>
Luna: <i>I tuck the flux ring away for safe-keeping.</i>
<<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump TransporterPod>>
