title: TransporterPod
---
<<camera AlleywayClear>>
<<playMusic cyberpunkStakeout>>
<<place NubsPod>>
<<expression NubsPod closed>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
Luna: So the app didn’t crash out. But who leaves an AGENTS delivery pod out here…?
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
<<pose NubsPod PodRattle>>
<<playSFX podRattle>>
Luna: (And who’d put a LIVING CREATURE inside one!?)

-> Put it on the motorcycle
   <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
   Luna: (I can't just unlock it. That's against SL0P protocol.)
   Luna: (And I can't afford another bad rating. I'd get suspended.)
   Luna: <i>I carefully pick up the transporter pod from the ground.</i>
   // SFX unlock sound
   <<playSFX podUnlock>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
   Luna: <i>But my fingerprints unlock it and bypass the pod's DNA-encoded password security.</i>
   Luna: (This delivery is…meant for me?)
   Luna: (Why does this pod have my DNA…?)
   <<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
   <<wait 1>>
   <<exit Luna_Neutral>>
   <<exit NubsPod>>
-> Get closer to inspect it
   <<jump InspectPod>>
-> Kick it around
   <<jump KickPod>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump MeetLilGuy>>
===


title: KickPod
---
<<set $badend += 1>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
<<playSFX kickPod>>
Luna: Fuck AGENTS!
Luna: <i>It feels good to stick it to the tech overlords.</i>
Luna: <i>Everything AGENTS makes is all the same.</i>
Luna: <i>Slop.</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: <i>I pick the transporter pod up.</i>
// SFX unlock sound
<<playSFX podUnlock>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Luna: <i>But when I do, my fingerprints unlock it and bypass the pod's DNA-encoded password security.</i>
Luna: This delivery is…meant for me? But why?
Luna: (Why does this pod have my DNA…?)
Luna: <i>And what kind of monster did I just unleash?</i>
<<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<pose NubsPod SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit NubsPod>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump MeetLilGuy>>
===

title: InspectPod
---
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Luna: <i>There's a fingerprint sensor attached to the pod. It's DNA-encoded, which is pretty high security for an underpaid driver like me to be handling.</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
???_T.A.B: Free me from this pod, you strange creature!
Luna: (I'M the strange creature?!)

-> Unlock the pod
   <<set $goodend += 1>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
   Luna: I can't believe I'm taking orders from a talking pod…
   Luna: (I'm basically asking for permanent account suspension.)
   Luna: <i>I place my hand on the pod's fingerprint sensor.</i>
   // SFX unlock sound
   <<playSFX podUnlock>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
   Luna: !!!
   Luna: <i>It unlocks with my biometric data.</i>
   Luna: (This delivery is…meant for me? HOW?)
   Luna: (And why does this pod have my DNA…?)
-> Don't unlock it
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>  
   Luna: I can’t. It’s against SL0P protocol.
   Luna: (And I can't afford another bad review. I'd get suspended.)
   ???_T.A.B: Did you not hear me, foreign entity?! I wish to be released. Now!
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
   Luna: You’ll be released when you’re delivered.
   Luna: <i>I pick up the transporter pod and place it on my bike.</i>
   // SFX unlock sound
   <<playSFX podUnlock>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
   Luna: <i>But I wasn't expecting it to unlock with my biometric data.</i>
   Luna: (This delivery is…meant for me?)
   Luna: (But why does this pod have my DNA…?!)
   <<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit NubsPod>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump MeetLilGuy>>
===


title: MeetLilGuy
---
// Fade in to show the CG with the transporter pod opened and Lil Guy revealed. Let’s NOT call in character sprites.
<<camera LilGuyCG>>
<<playMusic wanderingat3am>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
???_T.A.B: Ah, so you are not a foreign entity. Just a human.
???_T.A.B: 65% oxygen, 18% carbon, 10% hydrogen, and 3% nitrogen. And with a very concerning crane game addiction.
Luna: And YOU’RE some kinda state-of-the-art cyberpet that talks and scans…body particles?
Luna: (AND scans embarrassing information. Nobody heard that, right?!)
???_T.A.B: I'm not a pet! I’m T.A.B.
Luna: Tab…?
???_T.A.B: Technologically Advanced Broseph. Fit for the future of all bro-kind.
???_T.A.B: My name's origin stems from a company naming event.
???_T.A.B: I could not just be called “bro.” It needed to be more technical, more SEO-optimized.
???_T.A.B: And so my name was keyword-stuffed to absolute perfection.
Luna: (I'm literally losing brain cells talking to this thing…)
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump LilGuyReaction>>
===


title: LilGuyReaction
---
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
<<camera AlleywayClear>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
// If player chose to Kick it around, show:
<<if visited("KickPod") == true>>
   <<place NubsPod>>
   <<expression NubsPod angry>>
   T.A.B: How dare you kick a perfect high-fidelity prototype like me around!
   <<pose NubsPod SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
   <<wait 1>>
   <<exit NubsPod>>
   <<place Nubs>>
   <<expression Nubs wave_angry>>
   T.A.B: My master will have your head for this! As well as the AGENTS Legal team! When they get their hands on that pod’s sensor—
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
   Luna: Whoa, hold up. I'm not the one that tossed you here like trash. I'm just the delivery girl. 
   Luna: Also…
   <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
   Luna: <i>I shove the transporter pod into the dumpster. The fingerprint sensor cracks, erasing any trace of my DNA in the process.</i>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_happy>>
   Luna: What sensor?
   <<expression Nubs angry>>
   T.A.B: …
   Luna: AGENTS tech is pretty fragile, huh? Not as ‘high-fidelity’ as it claims to be.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
   Luna: Now, as for you…
<<endif>>
//If else, show:
<<if visited("KickPod") == false>>
   <<place NubsPod>>
   <<expression NubsPod neutral>>
   T.A.B: So you eventually came to your senses. You realized that stealing intellectual property from the most powerful corporation in Area 415 was wrong and costly. You have my thanks.
   <<pose NubsPod SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
   <<wait 1>>
   <<exit NubsPod>>
   <<place Nubs>>
   <<expression Nubs neutral>>
   Luna: (Meh. The face was cuter.)
   T.A.B: As for my master, well. He will thank you with damage fees and lawsuits within the next 1-2 business days.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
   Luna: W-Wait, hold up! “Stealing?” I'm just the delivery girl. I didn't toss you here like trash!
   <<expression Nubs wave_angry>>
   T.A.B: It's too late! This AGENTS pod sensor has already captured your DNA, which can and will be used against you in the court of law.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
   Luna: Oh yeah?
   Luna: <i>I immediately shove the transporter pod into the dumpster and smear its sensor with unspeakable leftovers.</i>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral happy>>
   Luna: Oops! There goes my DNA.
   <<expression Nubs neutral>>
   T.A.B: Ah.
   <<expression Nubs loading>>
   T.A.B: Recalculating potential lawsuit probability to 15%.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
   Luna: Let's keep it that way.
   Luna: Now…
<<endif>>
<<jump LilGuyQuestions>>
===


title: LilGuyQuestions
---
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
-> What are you? <<once>>
   <<detour WhatAreYou>>
   <<jump LilGuyQuestions>>
   // Return to the original questions in LilGuyQuestions node, but remove this question since the player completed it.
