title: WhatAreYou
---
Luna: “T.A.B” is a stupid name. What are you, and what are you supposed to do?
<<expression Nubs loading>>
T.A.B: I am the property of AGENTS Incorporated and its magnum opus. Any other questions related to my enslavement are classified.   
Luna: AGENTS shelled out zillions for YOU? Don't flatter yourself.
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
===


title: WhoOwner
---
Luna: You mentioned a “master.” Who is it?
<<expression Nubs loading>>
T.A.B: That information is classified. The answer is hidden behind firewalls I can't even access.
Luna: Hiding information from the public? Classic.
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
===


title: HowSpeak
---
Luna: Why were you installed with a language microchip? I can’t believe people want their cyberpets to talk back.
<<expression Nubs wave_angry>>
T.A.B: I am NOT a pet!
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
T.A.B: I was programmed to speak in 25 languages. This was decided in my early concept days.
<<expression Nubs arms_happy>>
T.A.B: It is also what my master wanted. They found it highly marketable to the masses.
Luna: Yeah. And <i>cyberpets</i> are sold to the masses…
<<expression Nubs loading>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
T.A.B: I do not see the correlation.
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
===


title: Tonight
---
<<declare $bigJob= false>>
<<declare $tellTruth = false>>
T.A.B: One of the hazmat humans took me away and stuffed me in this pod, which you freed me from. And, if you are telling the truth—
<<expression Nubs loading>>
T.A.B: —Which you seem to be, based on my built-in lie detector technology. Your heartbeat and pulse rate are normal.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
Luna: Uh, invasive much?! Isn't this against, like, some data privacy law?!
<<expression Nubs loading>>
T.A.B: Incorrect. Scanning people without permission has been legal since 2026, with glasses that had built-in cameras.
Luna: (Ugh, he was DEFINITELY made by tech bros.)
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
T.A.B: The only possible conclusion is that I was stolen from the AGENTS lab.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: Did you see what they looked like?
<<expression Nubs worried>>
T.A.B: No. They took me when they were still in a hazmat suit. 
T.A.B: When one hazmat injects plutonium into your titanium-grade outer shell, they all start to look the same.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
Luna: W-Wait, you're a BOMB!?
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
T.A.B: The person didn't have any AGENTS tech implanted in them. I would've been able to scan and identify them if they did. Even if they were wearing a suit.
<<expression Nubs loading>>
T.A.B: You also don't have any AGENTS tech either, which is fascinating. I was programmed to believe that everyone in Area 415 would have something installed into their skin.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: Nope, no AGENTS for me. And I like to keep it that way.
<<expression Nubs confused>>
T.A.B: But why? Why would you not want to partake in the greatest inventions made by mankind?
Luna: And sign up for 24/7 surveillance? Hard pass.
Luna: But I guess you’re already recording me without my permission, Nubs.
<<expression Nubs wave_angry>>
T.A.B: It's “T.A.B”!
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: Nah. It's Nubs now.
Nubs: And who are you?!
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: If you can scan embarrassing stuff about me, then you can definitely scan for my name.
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
Nubs: I can't. You don't have AGENTS technology installed in your system to properly identify you.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_surprised>>
Luna: Then how did you know about my…?
<<expression Nubs arms_happy>>
Nubs: Because nobody can resist my adorable form! I was designed to be disarming so that nobody would suspect my hidden capabilities!
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: Ugh. It's Luna.
// SFX cyberdeck notification ping
<<playSFX notification>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
<<expression Nubs confused>>
Luna: <i>A notification flashes on my homescreen. My current delivery status for Nubs changes from “Pick up” to “Delivery on the way.” The notification reveals where to drop him off.</i>
Luna: (It's in Root Town.)
Luna: <i>I tap on the notification and try to find more information about the requestor. Nothing.</i>
Luna: (Why would someone want a cute little bomb roaming free in the streets…?)
// SFX cyberdeck notification ping
<<playSFX notification>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_surprise>>
Luna: <i>More delivery offers from the SL0P app appear on my cyberdeck. The rates are double what they usually are.</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
Luna: (Might as well squeeze another job in before riding back home…)

-> Choose the offer with a lower tip and easier dropoff
   <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
   Luna: Hop on, little guy.
   Nubs: Are you taking me back to AGENTS?
   Luna: What? No. I’m doing another delivery before I take you to Root Town. That's where the customer wants you.
   <<expression Nubs angry>>
   Nubs: So you have chosen violence. You want to continue kidnapping me.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
   Luna: (The lil guy's not buying it…)
   -> Lie and say the requestor is its master
       <<set $badend += 1>>
       <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
       Luna: I checked the SL0P app. The one powered by AGENTS. Your favorite.
       Luna: It said the customer was your master. And would an AGENTS product lie to me?
       <<expression Nubs wave_worried>>
       Nubs: Never! Perhaps this is the master's way of discreetly moving me to another location to continue experimentation.
       <<expression Nubs wave_happy>>
       Nubs: Very well! I would try my lie detector again, but I've run out of tokens to use that feature.
       Luna: (Phew…)
   -> Tell the truth and explain your situation
           <<set $tellTruth = true>>
           <<set $goodend += 1>>
           <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
           Luna: Look, I'm short on rent and need to complete this task so my roommate doesn’t kick me out.
           Luna: What if I pretend to drop you off in Root Town, then take you back to the nearest AGENTS facility? That way, we both get what we want.
           <<expression Nubs happy>>
           Nubs: Very well! I could scan you again to see if you are telling the truth. But your answer is sufficient.
           <<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
-> Choose the offer with a higher tip and harder dropoff
   <<set $bigJob = true>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
   Luna: Hop on, little guy.
   Nubs: Are you taking me back to AGENTS?
   Luna: What? No. We're doing another delivery before I take you to Root Town. That's where the customer wants you.
   <<expression Nubs angry>>
   Nubs: So you have chosen violence. You want to continue kidnapping me.
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
   Luna: (The lil guy's not buying it…)
   -> Lie and say the requestor is its master
       <<set $badend += 1>>
       <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
       Luna: I checked the SL0P app. The one powered by AGENTS, your favorite.
       Luna: It said the customer was your master. And would an AGENTS product lie to me?
       <<expression Nubs wave_worried>>
       Nubs: Never! Perhaps this is the master's way of discreetly moving me to another location to continue experimentation.
       <<expression Nubs wave_happy>>
       Nubs: Very well! I would try my lie detector again, but I've run out of tokens to use that feature.
       Luna: (Phew…)
   -> Tell the truth and explain your situation
       <<set $tellTruth = true>>
       <<set $goodend += 1>>
       <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
       Luna: Look, I'm short on rent and need to complete this task so my roommate doesn’t kick me out.
       Luna: What if I pretend to drop you off in Root Town, then take you back to the nearest AGENTS facility? That way, we both get what we want.
       <<expression Nubs happy>>
       Nubs: Very well! I could scan you again to see if you are telling the truth. But your answer is sufficient.
       <<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
<<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
<<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<pose Nubs SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit Nubs>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
<<jump Questline>>
// Questline dialogue is in the Questline.yarn tab
